{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore the fantastic world of Dark Elves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beneath Dokkalfar City's chapel lies an ancient convent now inhabited by a force of undead minions. The powerful palm scrolls of the\u00a0Lehte Amba have been unearthed by a maligned sorcerer named Erasmus. Vivi must stop him!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose between the way of might or shadows. Or forge your own path as you unlock the cunning abilities of a Dark Elf.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MegaQuest is a contemporary 2.5D action-adventure with gameplay that is classical in style. You will control a quick and deadly accurate Dark Elf named Vivi, who can slide, dash, levitate and shadow step through perilous biomes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/mq_ornate_spacer.png?t=1746020943\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/MQ_ViviCoverArt.png?t=1746020943\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/mq_ornate_spacer.png?t=1746020943\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classical 2D room-to-room, boss-to-boss progression. Modernized for the current era.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Responsive controls. Dodge, dash and slash through fantastic beasts and monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover a dark fantasy world filled with lore, explore secrets in a non linear map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get to know a whole city of your Dark Elf kin and follow numerous quests and side quests to gain unique spells, weapons, and XP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge your own path, build multiple loadouts, collect gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use tons of potions, poisons, and elixirs to modify your gameplay. Find ingredients to craft your own!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your time is respected. Minimal death penalties. Fast travel. Modernized QOL.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/mq_ornate_spacer.png?t=1746020943\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/mq_bone_thrower_v3.gif?t=1746020943\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/mq_shadow_stepper_v3.gif?t=1746020943\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/mq_ornate_spacer.png?t=1746020943\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Support Independent Developers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is currently being &quot;solo-developed&quot; (with a lot of great help) and is completely self-funded. It's a simple thing for indies, we are all trying to make the best games but it has been a very hard time for game development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please check out the playtest and demo(soon). If you like what you see. Please support this game! A follow or wish list goes a really long way for! Thank you for checking out MQ!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/MQ_DE_KIN.png?t=1746020943\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/MQ_Ornate_Header_2.png?t=1746020943\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3093910?t=1746020943","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3093910?t=1746020943","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/3271cb67975088b4fd775e473de37309e8a11080/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746020943","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/3271cb67975088b4fd775e473de37309e8a11080/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746020943","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore the fantastic world of Dark Elves</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beneath Dokkalfar City's chapel lies an ancient convent now inhabited by a force of undead minions. The powerful palm scrolls of the\u00a0Lehte Amba have been unearthed by a maligned sorcerer named Erasmus. Vivi must stop him!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose between the way of might or shadows. Or forge your own path as you unlock the cunning abilities of a Dark Elf.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">MegaQuest is a contemporary 2.5D action-adventure with gameplay that is classical in style. You will control a quick and deadly accurate Dark Elf named Vivi, who can slide, dash, levitate and shadow step through perilous biomes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/mq_ornate_spacer.png?t=1746020943\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/MQ_ViviCoverArt.png?t=1746020943\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/mq_ornate_spacer.png?t=1746020943\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Classical 2D room-to-room, boss-to-boss progression. Modernized for the current era.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Responsive controls. Dodge, dash and slash through fantastic beasts and monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Uncover a dark fantasy world filled with lore, explore secrets in a non linear map</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get to know a whole city of your Dark Elf kin and follow numerous quests and side quests to gain unique spells, weapons, and XP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Forge your own path, build multiple loadouts, collect gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use tons of potions, poisons, and elixirs to modify your gameplay. Find ingredients to craft your own!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your time is respected. Minimal death penalties. Fast travel. Modernized QOL.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/mq_ornate_spacer.png?t=1746020943\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/mq_bone_thrower_v3.gif?t=1746020943\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/mq_shadow_stepper_v3.gif?t=1746020943\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/mq_ornate_spacer.png?t=1746020943\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Support Independent Developers</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game is currently being &quot;solo-developed&quot; (with a lot of great help) and is completely self-funded. It's a simple thing for indies, we are all trying to make the best games but it has been a very hard time for game development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please check out the playtest and demo(soon). If you like what you see. Please support this game! A follow or wish list goes a really long way for! Thank you for checking out MQ!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/MQ_DE_KIN.png?t=1746020943\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/extras/MQ_Ornate_Header_2.png?t=1746020943\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["MegaQuest"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3093910/c18dcbf6d1f41565335d1db7bbb306f57e62d6b3/header.jpg?t=1746020943","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257093588,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257093588/movie480.mp4?t=1739701844","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257093588/movie_max.mp4?t=1739701844"},"name":"First Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257093588/54a3089ca4