rld as you take on the role of Vivi the Dark Elf. Confront formidable monsters with might and magic, fulfill quests, uncover secrets, and reclaim honor to the Dark Elves!","steam_appid":3093910,"support_info":{"email":"support@megaquest.gg","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://megaquest.gg"}